WEBVTT

00:05:29.579 --> 00:05:31.871
The embryos were
in Los Angeles, California.

00:05:31.913 --> 00:05:34.621
Neither Loeb nor Vergara
lived in Louisiana.

00:05:34.663 --> 00:05:38.496
But given Louisiana's definition
of embryos as people,

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:41.538
it would have been
fascinating, and concerning,

00:05:41.538 --> 00:05:44.788
if the court had been able
to rule on the case.

00:05:45.371 --> 00:05:47.121
Of course, these were celebrities.

00:05:47.163 --> 00:05:49.496
So we got to read
about their case in the news.

00:05:49.829 --> 00:05:53.496
But it could happen to anyone
who's gone through IVF.

00:05:54.246 --> 00:05:58.371
By contrast to the idea
that embryos are people,

00:05:58.371 --> 00:06:02.246
other laws and judges
treat embryos as property.